## What Problem This Solves

Fixes: gateway probe duration and connection latency become negative or inflate by a minute when the system clock changes during a probe.

## User Impact

User impact: gateway diagnostics report actual elapsed probe and connection time through successful and refused connections, so automation receives meaningful timing values.

## Why This Change Was Made

Measure the command aggregate and both handshake-result timing paths with the monotonic clock, keeping the JSON ts field as an epoch timestamp.

